"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 28.691,
"end": 39.811,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we get into the topic, In\u00eas Carvalho was on the previous episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension adjustments.",
