"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 39.811,
"end": 40.639,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 259,
"char_end": 272,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 40.639,
"end": 44.014,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to discuss today.",
"char_start": 273,
"char_end": 326,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 44.014,
"end": 51.317,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 In\u00eas Carvalho mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 344,
"char_end": 437,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.317,
"end": 59.008,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 438,
"char_end": 536,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 59.008,
"end": 61.015,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 537,
"char_end": 570,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 61.015,
"end": 64.602,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you believe about this, and have you revisited it?",
"char_start": 571,
"char_end": 630,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 64.602,
"end": 73.475,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "In short, most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 646,
"char_end": 783,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 73.475,
"end": 77.231,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 784,
"char_end": 842,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 77.231,
"end": 81.894,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The context matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 843,
"char_end": 915,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 81.894,
"end": 83.661,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "It's a useful framework.",
"char_start": 933,
"char_end": 957,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 83.661,
"end": 87.932,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 958,
"char_end": 1016,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 87.932,
"end": 89.26,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1032,
"char_end": 1052,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 89.26,
"end": 95.831,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1053,
"char_end": 1152,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 95.831,
"end": 100.345,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1153,
"char_end": 1221,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 100.345,
"end": 102.465,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1239,
"char_end": 1272,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 102.465,
"end": 107.025,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 1273,
"char_end": 1344,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 107.025,
"end": 107.66,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1360,
"char_end": 1370,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 107.66,
"end": 114.329,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you will need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1371,
"char_end": 1476,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 114.329,
"end": 117.441,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1477,
"char_end": 1526,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 117.441,
"end": 122.078,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The context matters because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1527,
"char_end": 1600,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 122.078,
"end": 123.792,
